This repository is a clone of Diskghost at commit 0034d79, with its history
kept and a remote named "upstream" for later updates.

What comes from Diskghost:

- crates/diskghost-core: the scanning, MFT and snapshot engine. Changed in one
  place, crates/diskghost-core/src/mft.rs, to fix folders counted twice. See
  docs/benchmarks/2026-11-core-acceptance.md for the evidence.

Diskghost's GUI, command line tool, duplicate finder and delete features are not
part of Diskly. The core library still contains its delete functions, because it
is kept as it is. Diskly does not call them, and a test enforces that.

Everything else in this repository was written for Diskly.
